{
  "version": "workflow-comparison-v1",
  "description": "New synthetic workflow benchmark: 20 independently designed tasks, five categories, for full_history/current_state_summary/memweft comparisons using the same source events. This is not customer-task evidence. Questions and answer keys are fixed before model evaluation; do not revise cases in response to model results. The runner supplies the same 16 unrelated archival facts per case; summaries maintain current state deterministically without seeing questions. Forget operations remove earlier values of the deleted key from all modes, and scope isolation applies equally to all modes.",
